    "Create a Fire Trap in the target location dealing 50 dmg on triggering. Duration is increased by 15. Range is increased by 100.": "在目标位置制造火焰陷阱，触发时造成 50 点伤害。持续时间 +15，范围 +100。",
    "Create a Fire Trap in the target location dealing 50 dmg on triggering. Duration is increased by 30. Range is increased by 200.": "在目标位置制造火焰陷阱，触发时造成 50 点伤害。持续时间 +30，范围 +200。",
    "Create a Fire Trap in the target location dealing 50 dmg on triggering. Trap stays for 30 seconds.": "在目标位置制造火焰陷阱，触发时造成 50 点伤害。陷阱持续 30 秒。",
